<title>USA: U.S. wheat, corn and barley export inspections.</title>
<headline>U.S. wheat, corn and barley export inspections.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Agriculture Department said the 20.419 million bushels of wheat, 26.841 million of corn and 394,000 of barley inspected for export in the week ended Oct 17 were for the following shipment from port areas or inland inspection points (1,000 bu).</p>
<p>	     Wheat     Corn	Barley</p>
<p> Lakes     2,486	Nil	  Nil</p>
<p> Atlantic    Nil	 63	  394</p>
<p> Gulf	8,232   26,374	  Nil</p>
<p> Pacific   9,438	Nil	  Nil</p>
<p> Interior    263	404	  Nil</p>
</text>
